<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SABLE, DON ISSUE FURTHER CAUTIONARY.</title>
<headline>SABLE, DON ISSUE FURTHER CAUTIONARY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sable Holdings Ltd and The Don Group Ltd on Friday advised that caution should continue to be exercised in dealing in their shares.</p>
<p>The two companies referred to an earlier announcment on June 18 in which they said that they were in talks which could have an effect on their share price.</p>
<p>Sable and The Don Group said that a further announcement would be issued in due course.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
